### Create Customer 1
# @name create a new  customer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jayani",
  "lastName": "Athukorala",
  "email": "jayani@test.com",
  "fullName": "Test Name",
  "password": "12345678",
  "street": "Teleborg",
  "city": "Vaxjo",
  "zipCode": "35257"
}

