### Create Promotion 1 (iPhone Discount)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/promotions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "IPHONE10",
  "startDate": "2026-06-01",
  "endDate": "2026-06-30",
  "discountPercentage": 10,
  "productIds": [1]
}

